   Liu, Lina; Fen, Ouyang; Liu, Weilin; Zhou, Zhanxiong; Yin, Biaobiao, Nanchang Inst Technol, Jiangxi Prov Key Lab Water Resources Allocat \& Eff, Nanchang, Peoples R China.},
